First, we'll set up the basic structure:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Advanced HTML Site</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header id="header">
        <nav id="nav">
            <ul id="nav-list">
                <li><a href="#home" id="nav-link-home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about" id="nav-link-about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact" id="nav-link-contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
        <!-- Home Section -->
        <section id="home">
            <h1 id="home-title">Welcome to My Advanced HTML Site</h1>
            <p id="home-description">This site is a showcase of advanced HTML features.</p>
            <!-- About Section -->
            <section id="about">
                <h2 id="about-title">About Me</h2>
                <p id="about-description">I'm a web developer with a passion for creating complex, interactive web applications.</p>
            </section>
            <!-- Contact Section -->
            <section id="contact">
                <h2 id="contact-title">Get in Touch</h2>
                <form id="contact-form">
                    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your Name">
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email">
                    <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Your Message"></textarea>
                    <button type="submit" id="submit">Send</button>
                </form>
            </section>
        </section>
    </main>
    <footer id="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2023 My Advanced HTML Site</p>
    </footer>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
This is just the basic structure, developer. Next, we'll add some CSS magic to make it look great:
```css
/* styles.css */

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
}

header {
    background-color: #333;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

nav {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

#nav-list {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
}

#nav-link-home {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
}

#nav-link-about {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
}

#nav-link-contact {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
}

main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

section {
    background-color: #fff;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

footer {
    background-color: #333;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    clear: both;
}

#contact-form {
    width: 500px;
    margin: 20px auto;
}

#name, #email, #message {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
}

#submit {
    background-color: #333;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
}
```
